WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Over in Chicago, same thing.

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.220
Mayor Johnson created no ice zones

00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:06.620
after agents got Benghazi'd.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.220
When in Antifa, Bonnie and Clyde rammed agents

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:10.380
with their cars.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.740
There was a call for backup,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.660
but a stand-down order went out on the radio.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.840
They got booked, but a Democrat-backed judge

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:21.100
just released them for having good ties to the community.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.340
The woman, who's a teacher,

00:00:23.340 --> 00:00:27.059
is accused of following ice agents in the car for 30 minutes,

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:29.360
doxing them live on Facebook,

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.080
had a gun in the car, and rammed them.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.200
Prosecutors say they're extremely dangerous.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.759
Ice agents already have bounties on their heads,

00:00:37.759 --> 00:00:40.759
and these judges are making it too easy.

00:00:40.759 --> 00:00:44.880
A Latin King shot caller just put out a $10,000 hit-out

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:47.160
on a Border Patrol commander.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.880
Whose side are these people on?

